        u"Did you know fifth generation models doesn't have any physical differences when compared to a human, minus the ports in their napes and under their ears?": u"第五世代は、うなじと耳の下にある接続端子を除けば、体の作りが人間と変わらないと知っていましたか？",
        u"Did you know who created you all along?": u"最初から、誰が自分を作ったか知っていたのか？",
