        u"Did you see that graffiti? I don't get it, White Cat disappeared years ago.": u"あの落書き、見た？ 妙だね。ホワイト・キャットは何年も前に姿を消したのに。",
        u"Did you see the plant? What about that? There's something there...": u"あの植物を見たか？ あれはどうなんだ？ 何かがある……。",
        u"Did you sleep in again, Cila?! I've been waiting out here ten minutes!": u"また寝坊したのか、シーラ？！ 10分も待たせてるぞ！",
